---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

// The policy text is held inline here, deliberately, rather than in a content
// collection. Collections run text through frontmatter and Markdown processing,
// which is where a quote or a dash quietly changes. This is a legal notice
// published to Google as Stewardmark's binding policy: it ships exactly as
// written, or not at all.
const title = 'Privacy Notice | Stewardmark';
const description =
  'How Stewardmark, LLC handles information collected through this website and our client portal.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="band legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <h1 class="legal__title">Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="legal__effective">Effective August 31, 2026</p>

      <p>
        This notice describes how Stewardmark, LLC ("Stewardmark," "we," "us"), a
        California limited liability company based in Berkeley, California, handles
        information collected through this website and our client portal.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Website analytics.</strong> We use basic analytics to understand how
        visitors use this site, such as pages viewed and general location. We do not
        use advertising pixels or sell visitor data.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Client portal sign-in.</strong> Access to our client portal is
        protected by Cloudflare Access. When you sign in with your Google or other
        identity provider account, we receive your name and email address so we can
        verify who you are. We do not receive your password.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Client intake and engagement information.</strong> When you complete
        our intake form or work with us, we collect the information you choose to
        provide, such as your name, contact details, organization, and information
        about your project or matter.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information to provide and manage our consulting services,
        respond to inquiries, secure the client portal, and meet our legal and
        professional obligations. We do not sell personal information, and we do not
        share it with third parties for their own marketing.
      </p>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        We rely on a small number of service providers to operate this site and our
        business, including Cloudflare (website hosting and portal security), Google
        (identity sign-in and business email), and similar infrastructure providers.
        They process information on our behalf to deliver those services.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention and security</h2>
      <p>
        We keep client information for as long as needed to serve the engagement and
        to satisfy legal, professional, and recordkeeping obligations, then dispose
        of it. We use reasonable safeguards to protect information, including
        encryption in transit and multi-factor authentication on the systems we
        control. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may contact us at any time to ask what information we hold about you, to
        request a correction, or to request deletion, subject to our legal and
        professional retention obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this notice can be sent to
        <Fragment set:html={'<!--email_off-->'} /><a href="mailto:privacy@stewardmark.ai"
          >privacy@stewardmark.ai</a
        ><Fragment set:html={'<!--/email_off-->'} />.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this notice, we will post the updated version here with a new
        effective date.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding: var(--section-pad-y) 0;
  }
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .legal__title {
    font-size: var(--text-h2-size);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .legal__effective {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-body);
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin: 8px 0 32px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 36px 0 10px;
  }
  .legal p {
    font-size: var(--text-body-size);
    line-height: var(--line-height-body);
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .legal a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }
</style>
